        "selector": "JSXOpeningElement[name.name='Tag'] > JSXAttribute > JSXIdentifier[name!=/^(?:scheme|variant|icon|children|key|ref|className|style|children)$/]",
        "message": "<Tag> doesn't accept that prop. Declared props: scheme, variant, icon, children."
